'''Stalker''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of untidy black and gray stripes. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black.

